%------------------------- ULS Command Help ------------------------------%
%Command ===>_ZCMD
+
 Enter a catalog level on the main panel. ULS lists cataloged data sets
 below that level using the ISPF LMDLIST service.
+
 Commands
   FILTER text       Keep names containing text (case insensitive)
   FILTER CLEAR      Remove the current name filter
   FIND text         Find a name; RFIND repeats the last search
   SORT NAME|VOL|SIZE|DEVICE [A|D]
                     Sort ascending or descending; no direction means A
   BROWSE n          Browse visible row n
   EDIT n            Edit visible row n
   VIEW n            View visible row n
   INFO n            Show volume, size, device, and migration status
   UP/DOWN/TOP/BOTTOM Scroll or reposition the list
   REFRESH           Rebuild the list for the current level
   TUTORIAL          Open the ISPF tutorial panels
   END               Exit the dialog
+
 Row numbers are relative to the filtered, sorted results. This dialog
 does not implement destructive or allocation operations.
+
 Press Enter or F3 to return.
)END
